<section class="bio">
  <div class="bio__text">
    <p>I'm a principal strategist, designer, and researcher with a habit of following interesting problems wherever they go. Sometimes that's a tricky enterprise service redesign. Sometimes it's a wild scenario about a future. Sometimes it's a synthesizer plugin I built on a Sunday.</p>
    <p>Either way, welcome to my party attic.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="bio__destinations">
    <h3 class="bio__destinations-heading">Destinations</h3>
    <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/shawnrcole/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="bio__dest-row">
      <span class="bio__dest-name">LinkedIn</span>
      <span class="bio__dest-arrow">&rarr;</span>
    </a>
    <a href="https://medium.com/@shawnrcole" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="bio__dest-row">
      <span class="bio__dest-name">Medium</span>
      <span class="bio__dest-arrow">&rarr;</span>
    </a>
    <a href="https://sentientspaces.bandcamp.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="bio__dest-row">
      <span class="bio__dest-name">Sentient Spaces</span>
      <span class="bio__dest-arrow">&rarr;</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .bio {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 64px;
    padding: 64px 40px;
  }

  .bio__text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .bio__text p {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .bio__destinations {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .bio__destinations-heading {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 400;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--color-text);
    padding: 10px 8px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-text);
  }

  .bio__dest-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 12px 8px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-text);
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 18px;
    transition: background 0.1s, color 0.1s;
  }

  .bio__dest-row:hover {
    background: var(--color-header-bg);
    color: var(--color-header-text);
  }

  .bio__dest-arrow {
    font-size: 20px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .bio {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 40px;
      padding: 40px 16px;
    }

    .bio__text p {
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    .bio__dest-row {
      font-size: 15px;
    }
  }
</style>
